    55	3. **KEEP — The river is a road (161st); the kit on the table.** The cord is knotted at the fives, the stake is number thirty-two, plus the mallet and the field ledger with the radius line. The Stair's designation sits in an unreadable index above the stopped line "third site confirmed on bearing". Karis learns the kit.
