    62	10. **KEEP — The handover (277th evening)**, in Vastin's stated order. First, the records: a courier's flat of six years of survey abstracts, the anomaly column ("Total"), six rows, "More than four", and the completion report as the last sheet. Second, the page: "—of the Architect: see the lower archive at Treswick, which holds it in full—". Third, the technician's sheet: the deep-layer line and the brush bar; Karis copies it and writes "not read". Seln goes still and does not say the sum. Vastin's vertigo; Karis owns the response. Cael's hand stays a hand's width from the page. Nobody says *west*.
