   467	- **Vastin** takes no order without walking it back before Millrace's "Stand there". He does not sit in front of the crew between the cut and the road's last post (281st).
   468	- **Cleon** is above ground with the crew only once (the yard fire). Otherwise he is at noon at his tavern, or on the stair. He takes no notice of Cael until he is told.
   469	- **Oryn's hands** never come off a person with nothing done before the young one (no deaths on her north circuit).
