+# Movement 006 — source-distance tracking
+
+## Verdict
+
+**Five genuine tracked passages.** The count excludes every protected unit in `protected-patterns.txt`, every protected unit in `BOOK_MAP.md` §10, every line quoted in `packets/MOVEMENT-006.md`, and event/fact overlap required by the packet or map. In particular, the leaf, both fragment notices, Hesk's note, the fixed fire speeches, the count-of-one light event, and the prescribed order of the reveal are not findings here.
